\par }{\f1 Psigar 2.9
\par Fixed bug in transfer routines that caused an invalid first record to be added to all files
\par 
\par PsiGar 2.8, Psiway 2.8, Psicon 1.1 09:08:1997-08-09
\par Fixed bug in waypoint transfers causing lockup if you had exactly 16 waypoints
\par Improved transfer routines to provide auto time out.
\par Added \ldblquote Fugawi\rdblquote  export options.
\par 
\par 
\par Psigar 2.7, Psiway 2.7, Psicon 1.0 12:01:1997.
\par Added PCX5 export.
\par 
\par Psigar 2.6, Psiway 2.6 12:10:1996
\par Fixed search bug in Psiway module that caused incorrect screen updating when search selected for a second time.
\par 
\par Psigar 2.5,Psiway 2.5 25:09:1996
\par Fixed bug in OSGB file editing, which caused valid OSGB waypoints to be declared outside the applicable range.
\par Removed 50 metre offsets from six figure OSGB waypoint entry routines.
\par Changed the "Return to Psigar" menu item in Psiway for "Psion x" to "Psion r".
\par 
\par Psigar 2.4, Psiway 1.3 09:09:1996
\par Added OSGB file editing, removed some Nag screens and Operation aborted dialog boxes.
\par 
\par Psigar 2.3, Psiway 1.2 18:08:1996
\par Added Limited OSGB support to Psiway
\par 
\par Psigar 2.2, Psiway 1.1 15:08:1996
\par Psiway.rsc, trkhead.tbf, rtehead.rbf and wayhead.wbf can now be stored on any drive.
\par Fixed bug in Psiway which did not allow for 0 degrees, some minutes west when editing waypoints in ddd.mm.mmm format.
\par Fixed bug in countdown loop id Psiway average waypoint option
\par Extended max time in Psiway average waypoint to 999 secs and built in escape option.
\par 
\par 2.1
\par Fixed bug in Database > Garmin routes which allowed comments to be used rather than waypoint names.
\par Fixed problem with invalid date in Garmin waypoint in recent GPS units.
\par 
\par 2.0_  16:07:1996
\par Added WayEdit to Psiway module. 
\par 
\par \page 2.0alpha 14:07:1996
\par 
\par Added Psiway module.
\par Added Split Track Database function.
\par 
\par 1.7 05:07:1996
\par 
\par Added improved sort routine to track log editing.
\par 
\par 
\par 1.6_ 10:04:1996
\par 
\par Added track log editing.
\par Fixed a bug in the time setting function which gave you a 1 in 256 chance of the time being set incorrectly.
\par Changed the registration details to a more secure method.
\par Fixed a problem with duplication of track log points when sending from Psion to Garmin in some circumstances.
\par 
\par 
\par 1.5_ 06:04:1996
\par 
\par Basically a modification to version 1.4_ to all
ow for the larger length waypoint and route records created by the GPS90. There is a potential problem when modifying routes for a GPS90 as this seems to store a lot of unknown information in the comments section of route waypoints and for some route wayp
oints comes up with crazy times i.e. year 2007.
\par 
\par 1.4_ 31:03:1996
\par 
\par Added new option to allow you to edit routes.
\par Added offset from Greenwich mean time to time setting option.
\par 
\par 
\par 1.3 27:03:1996
\par 
\par Added new option to allow you to set the time on the Psion from the gps.
\par This version was a response to a specific request and not a generally released version.
\par 
\par 
\par 1.2 19:03:1996
\par 
\par Fixes bug in transfer of waypoints between Garmin Psion Data files.
\par 
\par 
\par 1.1 15:03:1996
\par 
\par Initial release.
